WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.093
Object 1: which unit best describes the mass or capacity of a bag of rice? Let us

00:00:06.093 --> 00:00:10.253
think carefully. Choose mass units for weight and capacity units for liquid

00:00:10.253 --> 00:00:12.680
containers. The answer is kg. Great work!

00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:19.276
Object 2: which unit best describes the mass or capacity of a paperclip? Let us think

00:00:19.276 --> 00:00:23.941
carefully. Choose mass units for weight and capacity units for liquid containers. The

00:00:23.941 --> 00:00:25.736
answer is g. Great work!

00:00:26.617 --> 00:00:32.560
Object 3: which unit best describes the mass or capacity of a bucket of water? Let us

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:36.756
think carefully. Choose mass units for weight and capacity units for liquid

00:00:36.756 --> 00:00:39.203
containers. The answer is L. Great work!

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:45.905
Object 4: which unit best describes the mass or capacity of a tea spoon of water? Let

00:00:45.905 --> 00:00:50.394
us think carefully. Choose mass units for weight and capacity units for liquid

00:00:50.394 --> 00:00:52.812
containers. The answer is mL. Great work!
